### AppChat API Testing - New Endpoints

# ===== BASE URLs =====
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5047
@accessToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Register User (for testing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "password": "test123",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "password": "test123"
}

### 3. Edit Message
PUT {{baseUrl}}/message/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": 1,
  "content": "Updated message content"
}

### 4. Delete Message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/message/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Search Messages in Chat
GET {{baseUrl}}/message/search/1?q=hello
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Get Chat by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Archive Chat
PUT {{baseUrl}}/chat/1/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Unarchive Chat
PUT {{baseUrl}}/chat/1/unarchive
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Delete Chat
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chat/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Block User
POST {{baseUrl}}/blocking/block
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blockerId": 1,
  "blockedUserId": 2
}

### 11. Unblock User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/blocking/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blockerId": 1,
  "blockedUserId": 2
}

### 12. Get Blocked Users List
GET {{baseUrl}}/blocking/list/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 13. Check if User is Blocked
GET {{baseUrl}}/blocking/check?blockerId=1&blockedUserId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. Check if Blocked Both Ways
GET {{baseUrl}}/blocking/check-both?userId1=1&userId2=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. Mark Message as Read
POST {{baseUrl}}/readreceipt/mark
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": 1,
  "userId": 2
}

### 16. Get Read Receipts for Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/readreceipt/message/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 17. Check if Message Read by User
GET {{baseUrl}}/readreceipt/check?messageId=1&userId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 18. Get Read Count for Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/readreceipt/count/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 19. Get Conversations (existing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 20. Send Message (existing - for reference)
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/send
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="SenderId"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ReceiverId"

2
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Content"

Test message
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="FileType"

text
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
